Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:52.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:02.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, tommo, Zero_Amamiya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.21,0:00:57.38,italics,,0,0,0,,One day, Deho was struck by a terrible drought
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.26,0:01:02.72,italics,,0,0,0,,So strong that Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:04.55,italics,,0,0,0,,exhausted
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.89,0:01:15.56,italics,,0,0,0,,The magicians of Deho performed a great ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.65,0:01:17.36,italics,,0,0,0,,to fill the lake with energy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.24,0:01:26.62,italics,,0,0,0,,The ritual caused heavy hail
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.04,0:01:39.67,italics,,0,0,0,,Among all the hailstones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.75,0:01:42.63,italics,,0,0,0,,there was one who did not melt
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.72,0:01:49.55,italics,,0,0,0,,This hailstone first turned into fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.22,0:01:51.52,italics,,0,0,0,,then stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:53.81,italics,,0,0,0,,and then into the water
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.77,0:01:58.23,italics,,0,0,0,,Then she returned to the beginning again - she became ice
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.11,0:02:01.78,italics,,0,0,0,,At the same time, black dust was released
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.69,0:02:07.49,italics,,0,0,0,,This dust was called Reflector and was used in the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.08,0:02:14.04,italics,,0,0,0,,The power of the reflector was truly amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.91,0:02:19.79,italics,,0,0,0,,You can bring a dead person back to life by calling his soul
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.38,0:02:23.30,italics,,0,0,0,,We can exchange bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.17,0:02:27.26,italics,,0,0,0,,You can even expel the soul from the body
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:29.85,italics,,0,0,0,,and capture his energy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.23,0:02:41.02,italics,,0,0,0,,As a result, this limitless power created chaos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.99,0:02:54.12,italics,,0,0,0,,The country turned into a bloody mess because of the magicians,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.87,0:02:59.79,italics,,0,0,0,,who unleashed a massacre for the reflector
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:11.60,italics,,0,0,0,,The man who stopped this chaos,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.31,0:03:17.31,italics,,0,0,0,,was master So Kyung, founder of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.07,0:03:28.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I was his student
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:31.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Such an amazing ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:34.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is he now? I want to see
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:37.29,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a very scary stone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.37,0:03:39.08,general text,,0,0,0,,The magic of this stone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:42.79,general text,,0,0,0,,created terrible things that can hurt people
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:46.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Baby, where did you find this doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:48.51,general text,,0,0,0,,In the mountains
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.30,0:03:54.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you trade for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.97,0:03:55.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:07.15,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a damned relic
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:17.58,general text,,0,0,0,,- What was that?\N- What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.66,0:04:20.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Dangerous item created by magic
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.79,0:04:23.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I know what it is. Relics
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.25,0:04:25.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Jinyeowon is full of them
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.17,0:04:28.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.46,0:04:31.30,general text,,0,0,0,,There are many much more dangerous objects in Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.63,0:04:34.97,italics,,0,0,0,,There are many peculiar objects there,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.05,0:04:37.35,italics,,0,0,0,,created by the power of the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.19,0:04:48.69,general text,,0,0,0,,They are waiting for the opportunity to get out into the light again
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.25,0:05:03.79,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to take it with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:05.75,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I don’t want
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:09.67,memories,,0,0,0,,Let me be Won Mu Deok, whom everyone avoids,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:13.13,memories,,0,0,0,,but I don’t serve everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:15.39,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare she?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:17.89,general text,,0,0,0,,She should have been grateful
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.97,0:05:21.60,general text,,0,0,0,,This cinnamon and ginger wine has a very strong cinnamon aroma
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.43,0:05:23.94,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.98,0:05:28.61,memories,,0,0,0,,Smells like cinnamon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.32,0:05:33.53,general text,,0,0,0,,So impudent
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.61,0:05:35.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Is something bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.20,0:05:37.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently, I got dirty about Won Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:40.37,general text,,0,0,0,,The stench does not go away
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.41,0:05:42.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Smells good
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.42,0:05:47.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget. Go
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.88,0:05:49.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Go away already
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:51.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.85,0:06:01.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I was merciful, saved her from trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.93,0:06:04.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Gave her a sachet and a silk dress
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.73,0:06:14.07,general text,,0,0,0,,So ungrateful
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.03,0:06:21.74,general text,,0,0,0,,- I’m grateful\N- I told you to leave...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.37,0:06:29.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Stink Mu Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:31.29,general text,,0,0,0,,How did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.46,0:06:35.30,general text,,0,0,0,,I have your sachet
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.93,0:06:40.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I came because you need something from me again
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:42.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about me, Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.01,0:06:44.10,general text,,0,0,0,,that's why I came
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:46.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you read my mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:50.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Excellent
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.23,0:06:56.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Drink some cinnamon and ginger wine. The aroma is stronger than last time
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.41,0:07:07.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Smells wonderful
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.37,0:07:10.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:18.47,general text,,0,0,0,,I have to say, I like this place
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.30,0:07:23.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope you will continue to think of me as you do today
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:26.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I will come to you every time
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.19,0:07:40.24,general text,,0,0,0,,The palace is a good place
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:45.70,general text,,0,0,0,,You wear silk,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:50.17,general text,,0,0,0,,drinking fragrant wine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:54.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know why I thought about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:08:00.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Because you are Won Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.18,0:08:05.26,general text,,0,0,0,,But now you don’t smell bad
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:08.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.77,0:08:09.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:20.86,general text,,0,0,0,,You caught me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:36.21,general text,,0,0,0,,The villain snuck in here
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.29,0:08:37.75,general text,,0,0,0,,- Search everything\N{\i1}- Yes, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.84,0:08:44.68,general text,,0,0,0,,But why in the guise of Moo Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.64,0:08:54.06,general text,,0,0,0,,View every corner
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:55.44,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.53,0:09:01.24,general text,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince is here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.03,0:09:03.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:11.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for someone
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:13.79,general text,,0,0,0,,They told me I'll find it here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.42,0:09:18.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Did something happen? Look worried
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:22.30,general text,,0,0,0,,The maid created problems and disappeared, we are looking for her
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.38,0:09:23.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.47,0:09:25.22,general text,,0,0,0,,She doesn’t work for us
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.30,0:09:27.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Doc. Chan family maid
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.55,0:09:29.18,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s what I’m looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:31.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.48,0:09:34.48,general text,,0,0,0,,This maid...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.94,0:09:38.90,general text,,0,0,0,,accidentally broke the yin-yang jade that was intended
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.52,0:09:40.82,general text,,0,0,0,,for wedding rings
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:47.74,memories,,0,0,0,,I told you to be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:49.16,memories,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.87,0:09:51.08,memories,,0,0,0,,Sorry, madam
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.70,0:09:52.95,memories,,0,0,0,,Forgive me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.50,0:09:55.29,memories,,0,0,0,,I will call its owner here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.37,0:09:57.46,memories,,0,0,0,,Lock her in the annex
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.63,0:10:01.59,memories,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.42,0:10:03.46,memories,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.55,0:10:05.76,italics,,0,0,0,,Probably afraid of punishment
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:09.05,italics,,0,0,0,,While she was locked up, she stole jade and ran away
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:15.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Given that we have not found her yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.44,0:10:18.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I think she has already left this place
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.15,0:10:21.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Frightened and ran away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.61,0:10:24.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Such a brave girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.78,0:10:28.74,general text,,0,0,0,,The Mages of Jeonjingak have arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.17,0:10:40.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, what brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.25,0:10:41.84,general text,,0,0,0,,And you, Yul?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:43.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Looking for someone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:46.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you also looking for Moo Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:48.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:50.97,general text,,0,0,0,,I came because of her
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:11:01.19,general text,,0,0,0,,She broke the jade,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.27,0:11:03.57,general text,,0,0,0,,and then ran away so as not to be punished
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.23,0:11:07.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you make a ring that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.32,0:11:12.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I came to Chwisongru to “lend” my hand, but they told me you left
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.16,0:11:16.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I decided to do them later
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.71,0:11:20.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, why are you looking for Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:24.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw the same vision as you, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.69,0:11:46.32,general text,,0,0,0,,How did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.95,0:11:51.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I came because you missed me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.66,0:11:55.91,general text,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:11:59.58,general text,,0,0,0,,You missed the one you met in Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.66,0:12:01.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:02.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Missed you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.17,0:12:05.00,general text,,0,0,0,,- Nothing of the kind\N- {\i1}False
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.09,0:12:06.92,general text,,0,0,0,,You whistled
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.43,0:12:13.18,general text,,0,0,0,,The broken leg didn’t bother you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:16.85,general text,,0,0,0,,And you weren’t afraid that they would scold you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:20.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Because you liked her
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.73,0:12:28.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Keep thinking about her
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.74,0:12:38.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I will come to you again
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:45.08,general text,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:46.96,general text,,0,0,0,,not human
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.10,0:12:59.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you get rid of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.23,0:13:03.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Then we won't see each other again
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.47,0:13:36.39,general text,,0,0,0,,It wasn’t her. Just a vision
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:40.64,general text,,0,0,0,,So it was a vision?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.72,0:13:43.52,general text,,0,0,0,,It was strange, so I came to Jwiseonru to find Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.10,0:13:45.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I was told that she was dragged here
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:49.11,general text,,0,0,0,,They didn’t drag her. She had an errand
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.90,0:13:52.53,general text,,0,0,0,,And she disappeared with an important relic
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:56.11,general text,,0,0,0,,We are looking for a thief, not a vision
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.79,0:14:02.91,general text,,0,0,0,,And here is her owner
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.47,0:14:21.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li is not here again today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.85,0:14:24.14,general text,,0,0,0,,This man is like the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.85,0:14:26.35,general text,,0,0,0,,He left me the dog and left
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:30.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Is Gwigu also created from ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.15,0:14:33.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Master So Kyung made it from the energy of the stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:36.15,general text,,0,0,0,,to find traces of witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.28,0:14:39.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk broke Gwiga’s urn,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.99,0:14:42.99,general text,,0,0,0,,so Master Lee returned his soul from Jinyowon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.70,0:14:45.33,general text,,0,0,0,,and put it in this dog
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.41,0:14:48.71,general text,,0,0,0,,You really don’t know where Master Seo Kyung is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:51.13,general text,,0,0,0,,sealed the stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:53.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.96,0:14:57.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think the alchemy of souls has spread again,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:15:00.09,general text,,0,0,0,,because someone found a stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.64,0:15:04.97,general text,,0,0,0,,The only way to transmigrate a soul without mastering Hwangsu is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:07.23,general text,,0,0,0,,use stone
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.77,0:15:10.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure someone printed it out
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.23,0:15:12.77,general text,,0,0,0,,and returning to the light
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.03,0:15:16.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, this is not good
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.15,0:15:20.28,general text,,0,0,0,,The horror of 200 years ago cannot be allowed to happen again
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:24.91,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to find an ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.59,0:15:37.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I was ordered to give this to you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.39,0:15:50.14,italics,,0,0,0,,I thought you would lay low for now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.23,0:15:53.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you help someone else migrate?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.53,0:15:59.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell me that I received the parcel
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.45,0:16:01.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.20,0:16:10.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and find me a eunuch to replace him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:16.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Your soul will migrate into his body, choose wisely
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.92,0:16:18.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:21.18,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I served Dan Zhu
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.26,0:16:23.26,offscreen,,0,0,0,,not to migrate into the body of a eunuch
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.35,0:16:27.35,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I use Nak Su,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.93,0:16:29.77,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,to get the body I want
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.90,0:16:41.20,general text,,0,0,0,,My maid did a terrible thing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.70,0:16:43.70,general text,,0,0,0,,As her owner, I will bear full responsibility
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.03,0:16:46.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:53.08,general text,,0,0,0,,You're probably upset that the jade for the rings is broken
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.29,0:16:56.63,general text,,0,0,0,,I begged my mother for this jade,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:16:59.59,general text,,0,0,0,,because the rings are made of it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.67,0:17:01.84,general text,,0,0,0,,will make the marriage long and happy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.80,0:17:04.18,general text,,0,0,0,,But it is broken
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.26,0:17:06.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t know it had such a deep meaning
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:08.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I must say that I am also upset
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.39,0:17:14.48,general text,,0,0,0,,We will find a more suitable jade for the rings
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.23,0:17:19.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I accept your apology
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.48,0:17:22.65,general text,,0,0,0,,- You can go\N- Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.74,0:17:23.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.95,0:17:27.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I must find Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.08,0:17:32.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to find this evil maid,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.91,0:17:35.12,general text,,0,0,0,,so that she returns the yin-yang jade
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.96,0:17:39.71,general text,,0,0,0,,She is weak, her legs are short, she couldn’t go far
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.01,0:17:44.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to look for it myself
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.97,0:17:50.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I allow
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.22,0:17:52.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.93,0:17:56.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Now I would like you to open the door
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.56,0:18:00.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Door to Jinyeowon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.36,0:18:02.99,general text,,0,0,0,,where the relics are stored
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:26.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Only a member of the Jin family can open this door
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.18,0:18:30.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Now only Cho Young and I are capable of this
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.93,0:18:33.06,general text,,0,0,0,,She can’t be there
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:34.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw a vision
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.52,0:18:39.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe you were dreaming
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.81,0:18:42.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you so sure that the vision was created by a relic?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.07,0:18:44.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw it too
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.95,0:18:47.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Vision in the image of Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.74,0:18:53.12,general text,,0,0,0,,All relics that visions can create are in Jinyowon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.20,0:18:54.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Let us check
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.62,0:18:57.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll open the door
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.46,0:19:03.25,general text,,0,0,0,,This place is full of dangerous relics
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.67,0:19:06.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Evil can take possession of you so that you cannot return
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.26,0:19:10.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr, this is too dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:13.51,italics,,0,0,0,,I'll go with him
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.27,0:19:18.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll go too
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.07,0:19:24.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Sounds fun
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.94,0:19:27.44,general text,,0,0,0,,When else will you have a chance to get to Jinyeowon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:53.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Enter
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.26,0:19:54.81,general text,,0,0,0,,You have one hour
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.15,0:20:11.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I must tell the head
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.99,0:20:17.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.00,0:20:19.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.42,0:20:26.88,general text,,0,0,0,,So this is Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:31.76,general text,,0,0,0,,They say everything here is expensive. No amount of money can buy you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.84,0:20:34.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you be quiet? We're not on a walk
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.43,0:20:36.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you the owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.56,0:20:40.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Although, this is how it will be if you marry Jin Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.56,0:20:43.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.73,0:20:46.40,general text,,0,0,0,,All these jewels will be yours, Jin Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.36,0:20:50.65,general text,,0,0,0,,If you envy me so much, you can marry her yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.45,0:20:54.99,general text,,0,0,0,,But even after becoming the owner, how will you control all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.07,0:20:56.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Low-grade magician
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.41,0:20:58.74,general text,,0,0,0,,If you're so cool, can you touch something here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.62,0:21:02.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Chief Jinyeowon said not to touch anything here
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.71,0:21:05.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Justification. You're just scared
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:13.05,general text,,0,0,0,,- That’s it\N- What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:14.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.47,0:21:17.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.18,0:21:19.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Something strange here
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.64,0:21:22.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.44,0:21:24.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Frightened
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.94,0:21:27.77,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s dark in here, be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.86,0:21:32.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Was he really scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.40,0:21:34.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. When Yul gets scared, he confuses the direction
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.95,0:21:36.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.87,0:21:38.83,general text,,0,0,0,,This way
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.58,0:21:41.62,general text,,0,0,0,,There, yes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.08,0:21:47.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's all be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.80,0:21:52.17,italics,,0,0,0,,Yul is always so calm,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:55.34,italics,,0,0,0,,and so absent-minded when he gets scared
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.93,0:21:57.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Something like this
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.68,0:22:04.18,general text,,0,0,0,,So let's be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.94,0:22:06.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Be yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.19,0:22:09.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go together
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.73,0:22:48.48,general text,,0,0,0,,How did I end up locked here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.20,0:23:01.70,general text,,0,0,0,,I had to restrain myself
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.37,0:23:05.37,general text,,0,0,0,,There was no need to provoke her
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.33,0:23:08.87,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Told you to be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.96,0:23:12.00,memories,,0,0,0,,Wait here. Your master will come soon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.59,0:23:15.21,memories,,0,0,0,,Madam, what will happen to me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.30,0:23:18.38,memories,,0,0,0,,What else? You will be punished
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.18,0:23:21.43,memories,,0,0,0,,That’s not what I’m worried about
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.51,0:23:24.22,memories,,0,0,0,,They say that if you break the yin-yang jade,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.31,0:23:27.06,memories,,0,0,0,,you will never be happy in marriage
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.10,0:23:30.94,memories,,0,0,0,,What should I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.11,0:23:33.98,memories,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.07,0:23:35.40,memories,,0,0,0,,Don’t talk nonsense
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.53,0:23:38.28,memories,,0,0,0,,They say if you break this jade,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.36,0:23:41.41,memories,,0,0,0,,the person you love will never love you back
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.03,0:23:44.91,memories,,0,0,0,,All the gisaengs in Jwiseonru said so
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.99,0:23:47.50,memories,,0,0,0,,Is this true?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.58,0:23:48.71,memories,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.37,0:23:53.17,memories,,0,0,0,,You didn’t know, madam?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.79,0:23:55.34,memories,,0,0,0,,This can’t be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.71,0:23:59.51,memories,,0,0,0,,Then what will happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.22,0:24:04.89,memories,,0,0,0,,Why are you worried,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.60,0:24:07.35,memories,,0,0,0,,if I broke it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.81,0:24:13.77,memories,,0,0,0,,You were the one who broke it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.69,0:24:17.78,memories,,0,0,0,,They made me carry him to blame him for this
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.65,0:24:19.61,memories,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.86,0:24:24.45,memories,,0,0,0,,Poor thing. I should have said at least something to my mother then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.12,0:24:27.41,memories,,0,0,0,,If I humiliated her daughter in front of everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.20,0:24:30.37,memories,,0,0,0,,she wouldn’t forgive me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.96,0:24:32.25,memories,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.92,0:24:36.46,memories,,0,0,0,,but I fear your mother, the head of Jinyoung
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.76,0:24:41.26,memories,,0,0,0,,Are you so afraid of your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.84,0:24:44.76,memories,,0,0,0,,I may be afraid of mom, but I hate you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.89,0:24:46.93,memories,,0,0,0,,I will sell you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.81,0:24:50.23,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Like you said, my mom is very scary
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.31,0:24:53.69,memories,,0,0,0,,You will be sold for breaking the jade
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.27,0:24:55.48,memories,,0,0,0,,Very far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.40,0:25:38.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Did she run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.97,0:26:12.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should try climbing over the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.72,0:26:52.76,voiceover,,0,0,0,,How was she able to open Jinyoewon’s door?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.31,0:27:02.98,voiceover,,0,0,0,,So this is Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.57,0:27:10.12,general text,,0,0,0,,If you lock her inside, she might die
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.93,0:27:38.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.36,0:27:46.82,general text,,0,0,0,,So it’s you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.03,0:27:52.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Long time no see
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.02,0:28:21.19,italics,,0,0,0,,You won’t be able to leave
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.19,0:28:24.44,italics,,0,0,0,,It won’t break
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.27,0:28:27.61,general text,,0,0,0,,It won’t work!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.82,0:28:32.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Shut up
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.42,0:28:46.92,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Did she really die because she didn’t have magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.09,0:28:49.97,voiceover,,0,0,0,,What if she was just a vision...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.05,0:28:55.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.39,0:29:00.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I hear the sound of your every move
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.19,0:29:03.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Sound like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.81,0:29:06.06,general text,,0,0,0,,like two jade hitting each other
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.25,0:29:21.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.55,0:29:31.63,general text,,0,0,0,,An hour has passed, we need to leave
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.72,0:29:34.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere, I have to find her
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.09,0:29:37.47,general text,,0,0,0,,This place is too big, the three of us won’t be able to find her
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.55,0:29:40.81,general text,,0,0,0,,You came here to look around anyway, so you can go
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.68,0:29:44.48,general text,,0,0,0,,When did the vision of Moo Deok come to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.52,0:29:47.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know how she appeared
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.81,0:29:49.02,general text,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.74,0:29:54.45,memories,,0,0,0,,I came because you missed me
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.53,0:29:55.61,italics,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.70,0:29:56.87,general text,,0,0,0,,She told me that too
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.49,0:29:58.99,general text,,0,0,0,,That she came because I was thinking about her
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.08,0:30:02.83,general text,,0,0,0,,So her vision comes by thinking about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.58,0:30:04.83,general text,,0,0,0,,So you haven’t seen her
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.50,0:30:07.08,italics,,0,0,0,,She came to me and Yulia,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.17,0:30:09.75,general text,,0,0,0,,but not to you, although you are its owner
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.84,0:30:12.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you even think about Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.51,0:30:18.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I drank cinnamon and ginger wine
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.76,0:30:21.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you then get her so drunk that she smelled of cinnamon a meter away?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.85,0:30:22.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.81,0:30:25.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I gave her another sasha that day
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.85,0:30:28.69,general text,,0,0,0,,The smell of cinnamon must have come from him
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.69,0:30:30.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh, you’re talking about that sachet,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.73,0:30:34.40,general text,,0,0,0,,which she hung near the toilet to ward off flies?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.07,0:30:36.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Near the toilet?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.57,0:30:39.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Highness. It keeps flies away so well
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.79,0:30:44.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, what were you doing when the vision came to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.25,0:30:48.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.63,0:30:52.09,general text,,0,0,0,,- My mirror broke\N- Mine too
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.92,0:30:56.76,general text,,0,0,0,,It appears from the mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.09,0:31:00.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.64,0:31:06.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.03,0:31:20.16,italics,,0,0,0,,It’s not you, it’s a fake
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.24,0:31:21.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Vision
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.42,0:31:31.84,general text,,0,0,0,,So it’s you
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.92,0:31:39.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Is she locked in the mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.68,0:31:41.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.89,0:31:44.97,general text,,0,0,0,,We couldn't see what's inside, but we're sure she's there
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.64,0:31:46.85,general text,,0,0,0,,She was swallowed up by the mirror of Tosca
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.02,0:31:49.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Mirror of Longing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.35,0:31:51.73,general text,,0,0,0,,This relic creates visions
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.36,0:31:53.69,italics,,0,0,0,,using other mirrors,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.77,0:31:56.36,general text,,0,0,0,,to show what a person wants to see
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.65,0:32:00.20,general text,,0,0,0,,She doesn't have magic, so it must have consumed her,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.28,0:32:01.66,general text,,0,0,0,,when she looked at it
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.37,0:32:05.70,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to extract Moo Dok from the mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.79,0:32:09.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Our spells will not work because the energy inside is too strong
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.67,0:32:12.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Please take the mirror of Tosca out of Jinewon
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.50,0:32:14.67,general text,,0,0,0,,This is impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.00,0:32:17.96,general text,,0,0,0,,A relic swallowed a man
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.05,0:32:20.01,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s too dangerous to take the mirror out of there
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.47,0:32:23.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I command you as Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.35,0:32:24.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Take the mirror outside
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.93,0:32:30.73,general text,,0,0,0,,The Unified Council gave us an amulet to protect Jinyowon
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.81,0:32:32.94,general text,,0,0,0,,precisely in such situations
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.86,0:32:39.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t bear it even by the king’s order
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.99,0:32:43.49,general text,,0,0,0,,UK will not work
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.66,0:32:45.95,general text,,0,0,0,,without Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.03,0:32:48.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Then he will have to stay inside
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.33,0:32:51.71,general text,,0,0,0,,When the hour is up,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.79,0:32:53.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I will seal the door
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.80,0:32:57.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.59,0:33:00.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I found yin-yang jade
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.43,0:33:05.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok didn’t steal it
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.01,0:33:08.56,italics,,0,0,0,,I found it,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.64,0:33:11.14,italics,,0,0,0,,so take out the mirror of Melancholy and save Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.23,0:33:13.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook will die if he is locked inside
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.73,0:33:15.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t interfere
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.77,0:33:20.86,general text,,0,0,0,,As soon as the promised time is up, I will seal the door
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.58,0:33:38.09,italics,,0,0,0,,Don’t waste energy
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.17,0:33:40.26,general text,,0,0,0,,You know you can't break it
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.34,0:33:42.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You're just a vision
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.34,0:33:44.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am a vision
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.09,0:33:47.93,general text,,0,0,0,,The vision that shows the true you
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.52,0:33:55.31,general text,,0,0,0,,People cannot look at themselves from the outside
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.40,0:33:57.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Only a mirror can help them with this
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.94,0:34:01.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Therefore, your idea of yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.57,0:34:04.24,general text,,0,0,0,,also just a vision
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.95,0:34:10.99,general text,,0,0,0,,This is how others perceive you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.87,0:34:15.87,general text,,0,0,0,,They see only what they want, and they themselves create the image they need
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.54,0:34:19.88,general text,,0,0,0,,This is also a vision
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.55,0:34:21.92,general text,,0,0,0,,If you are telling the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.09,0:34:25.59,general text,,0,0,0,,which means people see only visions and nothing more
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.84,0:34:27.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.68,0:34:31.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I turn into what they want to see most and show them it
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.06,0:34:37.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll do the same for you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.15,0:34:46.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Give me your energy
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.78,0:34:47.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.03,0:34:51.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I will turn into the most ideal version of you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.04,0:34:58.21,general text,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.71,0:35:02.71,general text,,0,0,0,,you need my reflection to create such a vision
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.96,0:35:05.13,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.72,0:35:07.51,general text,,0,0,0,,If there is nothing to reflect,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.39,0:35:10.93,general text,,0,0,0,,the mirror will become useless
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.28,0:35:33.83,general text,,0,0,0,,You're just a piece of glass
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.58,0:35:37.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Enough talk
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.33,0:35:39.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.75,0:35:42.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.00,0:35:45.13,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.71,0:35:47.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.64,0:35:51.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.56,0:35:55.31,italics,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, I'm here
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.52,0:35:58.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Found
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.19,0:36:07.82,italics,,0,0,0,,Time's up
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.49,0:36:10.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young, seal the door
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.74,0:36:11.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.82,0:36:15.41,general text,,0,0,0,,- Now{\i1}\N- Please wait
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.30,0:36:28.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to log in
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.34,0:36:32.30,italics,,0,0,0,,If the relic cannot be taken outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.39,0:36:36.76,general text,,0,0,0,,then I myself will go in there and pull her out of the mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.85,0:36:39.93,general text,,0,0,0,,How can I allow a powerful magician to enter?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.02,0:36:41.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Trust me
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.10,0:36:44.69,general text,,0,0,0,,I will not lay a finger on a single artifact
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.77,0:36:46.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t even know
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.23,0:36:49.53,general text,,0,0,0,,The magician from Sosnovy Bor has already failed my trust
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.65,0:36:55.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you already let the magician of the Pine Forest into Jinyeowon?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.99,0:36:59.70,general text,,0,0,0,,If you want to save Chan Wook,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.79,0:37:03.54,general text,,0,0,0,,you will have to ask the magicians of Jeonjingak to get him out of there
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.71,0:37:08.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Chapter,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.84,0:37:10.01,general text,,0,0,0,,we don't have much time
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.55,0:37:15.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, I want you to come in
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.68,0:37:18.26,general text,,0,0,0,,and brought Uka out from there
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.81,0:37:24.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.02,0:37:27.36,general text,,0,0,0,,While you were away,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.61,0:37:30.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.95,0:37:33.24,general text,,0,0,0,,what can I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.57,0:37:36.66,italics,,0,0,0,,to keep you close
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.95,0:37:41.83,general text,,0,0,0,,If I become Jeonbugwan's gwangju,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.75,0:37:45.42,general text,,0,0,0,,you can become my deputy
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.33,0:37:48.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do I need this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.09,0:37:50.76,italics,,0,0,0,,You said that you don’t want to remain my maid
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.84,0:37:53.68,general text,,0,0,0,,We cannot tell anyone that you are my teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.76,0:37:56.30,general text,,0,0,0,,But you can stay if you become my assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.39,0:37:59.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Will Gwangju Jeongbugwan keep a nomad next to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.47,0:38:02.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.90,0:38:08.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought about this when I heard the news about my wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.27,0:38:11.23,general text,,0,0,0,,"He finally has an escape route"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.32,0:38:14.07,general text,,0,0,0,,"How will I live without him?"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.82,0:38:17.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you felt lost
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.71,0:38:25.33,general text,,0,0,0,,When you're not around, neither am I
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.67,0:38:28.96,general text,,0,0,0,,feeling lost
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.89,0:38:45.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.15,0:38:48.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I miss you
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.43,0:39:24.18,memories italics,,0,0,0,,If they catch me, pretend you don’t know anything
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.02,0:39:27.85,memories,,0,0,0,,No one here will allow this beast to attack me
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.19,0:39:35.90,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Then help me
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.99,0:39:37.86,memories italics,,0,0,0,,go up there
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.53,0:39:39.36,memories,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.45,0:39:42.91,memories,,0,0,0,,I'll take you to the top of this tree
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.78,0:40:16.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.19,0:40:18.19,general text,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.49,0:40:21.66,italics,,0,0,0,,She's here
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.74,0:40:22.95,italics,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.53,0:40:25.49,italics,,0,0,0,,It’s her, the blind girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.33,0:40:27.70,italics,,0,0,0,,It's an ice stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.00,0:40:33.50,general text,,0,0,0,,The mirror will break into pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.21,0:40:35.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Move away
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.86,0:41:39.90,italics,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.40,0:41:41.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.74,0:41:44.07,general text,,0,0,0,,- Are you okay?\N- Everything is fine
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.16,0:41:46.07,general text,,0,0,0,,- Is Mu Dok safe?\N- Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.31,0:42:17.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I tripped while carrying the yin-yang jade
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.02,0:42:21.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I think it broke then
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.65,0:42:25.49,general text,,0,0,0,,So you tried to shift the blame onto the maid for the already broken jade
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.32,0:42:28.57,general text,,0,0,0,,And the mirror of Tosca?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.78,0:42:31.70,general text,,0,0,0,,It stood nearby,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.79,0:42:33.50,general text,,0,0,0,,but I didn’t even touch it
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.12,0:42:37.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk is not strong enough to break it
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.08,0:42:39.54,italics,,0,0,0,,Then it must be,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.63,0:42:42.80,general text,,0,0,0,,I damaged the mirror during the fall
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.93,0:42:48.26,general text,,0,0,0,,A Mu Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.05,0:42:51.97,general text,,0,0,0,,did you also lock yourself in Jinewon?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.06,0:42:55.69,general text,,0,0,0,,It was I who sealed the door, but she went inside on her own
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.77,0:42:59.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Only members of the Jin family can open the doors of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.19,0:43:02.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you saying Moo Dok was able to open them?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.78,0:43:06.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Then perhaps,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.15,0:43:08.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I opened them
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.57,0:43:12.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I just saw her going in there and closed the door angry
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.12,0:43:16.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.71,0:43:19.08,general text,,0,0,0,,I will say,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.67,0:43:23.59,general text,,0,0,0,,so that no one talks about what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.13,0:43:29.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t say anything either,\Nso as not to spoil your reputation
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.39,0:43:32.14,general text,,0,0,0,,My sincere apologies
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.06,0:43:37.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.06,0:43:39.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Still don’t see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.23,0:43:42.15,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.73,0:43:44.98,general text,,0,0,0,,When the mirror broke, the light was very bright
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.61,0:43:47.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t open my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.45,0:43:52.37,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to cover your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.00,0:43:57.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.54,0:44:05.34,general text,,0,0,0,,If you look at the sun for a long time, you can lose your vision for a while
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.09,0:44:07.30,general text,,0,0,0,,You'll get better soon
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.05,0:44:10.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Forgive me
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.14,0:44:12.60,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s not your fault
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.39,0:44:14.97,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s all Mrs. Jin’s fault
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.65,0:44:27.49,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.32,0:44:30.78,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, Mr. Dan Gu?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.57,0:44:33.99,general text,,0,0,0,,I was worried
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.62,0:44:35.99,italics,,0,0,0,,I hurt my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.58,0:44:38.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yul, have you come too?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.71,0:44:45.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Let them examine you in Sejukwon, I will take you there
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.92,0:44:47.84,italics,,0,0,0,,The palace is not far, she can go there
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.34,0:44:50.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, are you here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.10,0:44:57.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I will provide you with the king’s healers
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.47,0:44:59.85,italics,,0,0,0,,Nothing needed
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.93,0:45:03.19,general text,,0,0,0,,She is blinded by the light, her eyes are not damaged
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.23,0:45:07.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I know it’s not your fault,\Nbut they came here because of you
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.44,0:45:10.15,general text,,0,0,0,,So apologize and thank everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.20,0:45:14.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry to disturb you
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.32,0:45:16.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.30,0:45:30.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.01,0:45:33.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go home
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.24,0:45:59.20,general text,,0,0,0,,After what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.41,0:46:03.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know what will happen to the wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.29,0:46:04.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what she said?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.50,0:46:08.50,general text,,0,0,0,,She was ready to seal the door, despite the fact that the master was inside
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.13,0:46:10.25,general text,,0,0,0,,What a horror
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.34,0:46:13.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Worries that he will have such a mother-in-law
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.42,0:46:15.51,general text,,0,0,0,,She did this to protect Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.26,0:46:18.26,italics,,0,0,0,,When you have something to protect,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.35,0:46:21.47,general text,,0,0,0,,sometimes you have to make tough decisions
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.14,0:46:23.31,general text,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.31,0:46:25.94,general text,,0,0,0,,would you do the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.35,0:46:30.23,general text,,0,0,0,,I dare to say that you and I are close
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.32,0:46:33.74,general text,,0,0,0,,If I were inside? Would you seal the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.61,0:46:35.53,general text,,0,0,0,,So merciless?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.16,0:46:41.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.16,0:46:43.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Seems like you would do this
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.75,0:46:46.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Even if my life was at stake?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.96,0:46:49.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t put me in a difficult position
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.63,0:46:52.25,general text,,0,0,0,,due to a fictitious event
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.34,0:46:54.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m not really locked
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.92,0:46:57.30,italics,,0,0,0,,It’s hard to lie and say,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.38,0:46:59.60,general text,,0,0,0,,- that you would never seal the door?{\i1}\N- I can’t
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.10,0:47:03.64,general text,,0,0,0,,lie to you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.60,0:47:06.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.81,0:47:09.86,general text,,0,0,0,,This is what you should do
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.36,0:47:16.45,general text,,0,0,0,,You should say hello to Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.11,0:47:20.91,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s not worth it, I have nothing to say to him
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.12,0:47:24.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t act like everything is fine
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.08,0:47:28.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I see. Thanks for everything
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.75,0:47:29.58,italics,,0,0,0,,It’s time for you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.09,0:47:40.34,general text,,0,0,0,,But still, maid Kim,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.72,0:47:44.31,general text,,0,0,0,,if I had to seal the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.81,0:47:47.43,general text,,0,0,0,,that would break my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.15,0:47:51.52,general text,,0,0,0,,to pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.15,0:48:01.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Inflexible and slow-witted
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.16,0:48:06.79,general text,,0,0,0,,"How can I seal the door if you're inside?"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.25,0:48:10.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Couldn’t just say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.68,0:48:26.93,general text,,0,0,0,,It was dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.68,0:48:30.44,italics,,0,0,0,,Enter Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.52,0:48:33.11,general text,,0,0,0,,was a thoughtless childish act
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.19,0:48:34.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t be so angry
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.36,0:48:38.36,general text,,0,0,0,,You might think I'm pathetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.45,0:48:40.57,general text,,0,0,0,,but this is just your vision
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.62,0:48:43.45,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.53,0:48:45.70,general text,,0,0,0,,The mirror in Jinyowon told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.29,0:48:48.16,general text,,0,0,0,,that people only see what
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.25,0:48:50.50,general text,,0,0,0,,what they want
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.46,0:48:52.50,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a vision
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.58,0:48:54.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to say that you are like a vision to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.84,0:48:55.92,general text,,0,0,0,,If this is not the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.13,0:48:59.17,general text,,0,0,0,,why do you want me to sit idle?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.55,0:49:04.26,general text,,0,0,0,,All my life I've been desperately trying
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.26,0:49:07.64,general text,,0,0,0,,prove to everyone that I am my father’s son
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.72,0:49:08.68,general text,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.98,0:49:11.23,general text,,0,0,0,,you said it was not true
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.31,0:49:13.27,general text,,0,0,0,,It hurt me, but it helped me get rid of illusions
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.98,0:49:15.48,italics,,0,0,0,,But even after everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.56,0:49:17.73,general text,,0,0,0,,why do you want me to remain a vision?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.82,0:49:19.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t care who you are
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.65,0:49:22.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I only want one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.41,0:49:24.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Keep you safe...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.28,0:49:27.83,general text,,0,0,0,,from dangers
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.16,0:49:35.63,general text,,0,0,0,,My goal has now lost all meaning
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.92,0:49:39.34,general text,,0,0,0,,So from now on...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.84,0:49:42.34,general text,,0,0,0,,I will try
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.80,0:49:45.18,general text,,0,0,0,,find out who I am
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.72,0:49:48.22,general text,,0,0,0,,and who should become
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.59,0:50:20.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Now you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.76,0:50:23.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. I see
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.60,0:50:29.51,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.60,0:50:31.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I was told that that mirror plays with the imagination
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.97,0:50:34.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I had to check if I really saved you
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.19,0:50:38.61,general text,,0,0,0,,You didn’t save me. I broke it and got out myself
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.48,0:50:40.32,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.40,0:50:42.15,general text,,0,0,0,,When I got stuck in the mirror,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.82,0:50:45.07,general text,,0,0,0,,for a moment my strength returned,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.15,0:50:46.91,general text,,0,0,0,,as in Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.91,0:50:50.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I broke the mirror with my own strength
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.28,0:50:51.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.95,0:50:54.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I was so happy, I thought I saved you
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.12,0:50:55.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Rolled out my lip
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.29,0:50:57.92,general text,,0,0,0,,You should be grateful that you weren’t sucked into it
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.00,0:51:01.00,general text,,0,0,0,,You were inside, I was thinking about it
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.09,0:51:02.63,general text,,0,0,0,,What nonsense
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.13,0:51:05.05,general text,,0,0,0,,It wouldn’t trade you for me
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.13,0:51:07.47,general text,,0,0,0,,What if it sucked me in? So it's not such a lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.55,0:51:08.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, then I would have survived
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.01,0:51:10.35,general text,,0,0,0,,And I would die!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.10,0:51:15.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Listen, student. When the situation is hopeless,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.18,0:51:18.40,general text,,0,0,0,,the best solution is to sacrifice yourself and save me
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.48,0:51:19.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.27,0:51:22.65,general text,,0,0,0,,If I die, then you should too
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.73,0:51:24.40,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t live comfortably without me
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.07,0:51:27.74,general text,,0,0,0,,And nothing else!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.82,0:51:31.03,general text,,0,0,0,,If you put a student’s life in danger, then you must risk your own life
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.95,0:51:34.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll keep this in mind for the future
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.91,0:51:36.83,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do about marrying a woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.91,0:51:39.63,general text,,0,0,0,,who almost killed your teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.67,0:51:44.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Marrying her is a guarantee of my safety
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.80,0:51:48.76,general text,,0,0,0,,But you almost lost your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.38,0:51:51.18,general text,,0,0,0,,so I too must risk mine
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.64,0:51:59.56,italics,,0,0,0,,This is a marriage of convenience
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.19,0:52:03.23,general text,,0,0,0,,We will resolve all misunderstandings after the wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.32,0:52:05.86,general text,,0,0,0,,You consider me as a son-in-law,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.65,0:52:08.28,general text,,0,0,0,,because I am the heir of the Chan family
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.36,0:52:10.36,general text,,0,0,0,,and a possible candidate for the post of Gwangju Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.24,0:52:13.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Our families will unite and become more influential
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.33,0:52:17.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Since this is a marriage of convenience,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.16,0:52:20.62,general text,,0,0,0,,we should talk openly about our strengths and weaknesses
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.42,0:52:23.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Probably I am not the son of Gwangju Chang Gang
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.80,0:52:28.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Such rumors don’t bother me
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.26,0:52:33.10,general text,,0,0,0,,But what if these rumors...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.30,0:52:35.35,general text,,0,0,0,,really?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.27,0:52:40.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to take the risk...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.94,0:52:43.81,general text,,0,0,0,,and accept me as your son-in-law?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.03,0:52:58.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I see you are still wearing the bracelet
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.46,0:53:02.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.54,0:53:07.67,general text,,0,0,0,,As impudent as always
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.89,0:53:20.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you decide to marry Cho Young without discussing it with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.85,0:53:25.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Who are you to interfere in the affairs of our family?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.31,0:53:26.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.36,0:53:30.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I am also a member of the Jin family
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.82,0:53:36.45,general text,,0,0,0,,The surname Jin is given only to those whose mothers were from the Jin clan
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.70,0:53:41.41,general text,,0,0,0,,My mother was stupid, giving that last name,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.08,0:53:44.25,general text,,0,0,0,,whom our father conceived out of wedlock
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.96,0:53:47.88,general text,,0,0,0,,You will get rid of me as soon as you become the head of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.13,0:53:51.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Still mad at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.59,0:53:52.72,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s not a matter of offense
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.84,0:53:55.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I despise you
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.35,0:54:01.06,general text,,0,0,0,,You are a traitor, for this I despise you
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.94,0:54:08.11,general text,,0,0,0,,The head of Jinyeowon should not make decisions based on personal preferences
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.40,0:54:11.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Choosing Chan Wook, you are making a mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.99,0:54:13.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t marry Cho Young to Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.49,0:54:14.70,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.41,0:54:19.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I know the best match for her
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.99,0:54:21.37,general text,,0,0,0,,How do you like the Crown Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.20,0:54:23.83,general text,,0,0,0,,as a son-in-law?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.79,0:54:31.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want the Crown Prince to join our family and we live together?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.84,0:54:33.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young is the second daughter of the family
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.59,0:54:36.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Bu Young is the eldest, she will lead the family
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.01,0:54:39.22,italics,,0,0,0,,Her future husband will join the family,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.30,0:54:40.89,general text,,0,0,0,,so Cho Young can live with the prince in the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.43,0:54:46.60,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you up to? How dare you talk about Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.36,0:54:54.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I know that your husband is still looking for Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.53,0:54:58.20,general text,,0,0,0,,As the deputy of Gwangju Jeonbugwan,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.28,0:55:01.08,general text,,0,0,0,,I will do everything possible to help you find your daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.83,0:55:03.16,general text,,0,0,0,,which you are so desperately looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.00,0:55:08.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I will make Boo Young the head of Jinyoung, and Jo Young will become the queen
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.00,0:55:10.00,general text,,0,0,0,,So please,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.09,0:55:11.92,general text,,0,0,0,,don’t pass her off as Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.46,0:55:15.72,general text,,0,0,0,,How is your brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.47,0:55:19.93,general text,,0,0,0,,becoming Gwangju Jeonbugwan, I will support Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.39,0:55:23.47,general text,,0,0,0,,After all, I am a member of the Jin family
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.70,0:55:41.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Listen, Yul, that’s what’s strange
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.37,0:55:44.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Why were you thinking about Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.70,0:55:47.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t think about her
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.58,0:55:51.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I also don’t understand why the mirror showed Moo Dok...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.17,0:55:54.21,general text,,0,0,0,,- And those words of hers...\N- What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.96,0:55:56.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.21,0:55:57.59,general text,,0,0,0,,We’re actually heading that way
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.22,0:56:00.97,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking about there? What scares you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.64,0:56:07.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything is fine
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.85,0:56:11.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Holy spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.52,0:56:15.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Cart with parcels
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.65,0:56:20.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Cho Young's wedding gifts will be delivered to Sosnovy Bor today
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.70,0:56:23.58,general text,,0,0,0,,No one can see them
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.66,0:56:26.12,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to help her
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.09,0:56:41.55,italics,,0,0,0,,Bird! Catch the bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.64,0:56:42.93,general text,,0,0,0,,- What is this?\N- Catch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.60,0:56:44.97,italics,,0,0,0,,- What is this!\N- Where did she fly off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.64,0:56:48.18,italics,,0,0,0,,- Over there! \N- She's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.27,0:56:50.81,italics,,0,0,0,,- How can this be?\N- Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.77,0:56:53.94,italics,,0,0,0,,- Hey\N- Over there
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.10,0:57:29.98,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Nak Su masters the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.27,0:57:36.15,memories italics,,0,0,0,,If her soul left her body, she might still be alive
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.99,0:57:46.12,memories,,0,0,0,,You missed the one you met in Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.87,0:57:49.70,memories,,0,0,0,,Keep thinking about her
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.46,0:57:52.79,memories,,0,0,0,,Then I will come to you again
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.37,0:57:58.17,memories,,0,0,0,,Winters in Danhyangok are warmer than you think
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.17,0:58:02.47,memories,,0,0,0,,Where the sun shines, the snow melts quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.60,0:58:10.89,general text,,0,0,0,,So, Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.18,0:58:13.52,general text,,0,0,0,,this is Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.87,0:59:18.96,general text,,0,0,0,,It was you who left the spirit amulet in Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.30,0:59:26.63,general text,,0,0,0,,So you're alive, Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.07,0:59:50.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.74,0:59:52.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of waiting for you
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.03,0:59:54.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant Kim didn’t tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.70,0:59:56.25,general text,,0,0,0,,You should have arrived by noon
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.12,1:00:00.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry. We need to get to Danhyangok before sunset
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.04,1:00:02.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Instead of Danhyangok,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.42,1:00:05.84,general text,,0,0,0,,let's go somewhere else
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.01,1:00:08.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.13,1:00:11.72,general text,,0,0,0,,In the east there is an empty temple near a bamboo forest
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.22,1:00:13.43,general text,,0,0,0,,We can go there
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.64,1:00:21.98,memories,,0,0,0,,Bring Chan Wook there
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.06,1:00:23.61,memories,,0,0,0,,Then I will spare your life
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.45,1:00:31.28,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I must pass you on to live
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.07,1:00:33.28,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,That’s how it should be
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.08,1:00:37.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t get married
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.54,1:00:40.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I gave them a reason to refuse my candidacy
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.50,1:00:42.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.38,1:00:44.42,general text,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.59,1:00:50.30,general text,,0,0,0,,maid Kim has already received the yin-yang jade
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.97,1:00:52.68,general text,,0,0,0,,So I made something out of it
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.10,1:01:01.85,general text,,0,0,0,,- These are bird eggs\N- Correct
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.52,1:01:03.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Take one. We'll have one each
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.94,1:01:10.24,general text,,0,0,0,,We have a rather peculiar relationship
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.32,1:01:13.03,general text,,0,0,0,,The young master and the maid. Teacher and student
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.11,1:01:15.83,general text,,0,0,0,,So I thought they could remind us that
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.95,1:01:18.50,general text,,0,0,0,,so that we remain faithful to each other
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.21,1:01:23.46,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first to choose
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.54,1:01:25.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll take red, you take blue
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.76,1:01:33.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher, let's remain devoted to each other
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.81,1:01:42.81,general text,,0,0,0,,- Chan Wook\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.36,1:01:46.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Here we say goodbye
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.36,1:01:53.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll go back to where I came from
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.57,1:01:58.49,general text,,0,0,0,,- But they abandoned you\N{\i1}- Today I met them again
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.12,1:02:00.62,general text,,0,0,0,,They know who I am
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.45,1:02:03.21,general text,,0,0,0,,So they asked me to come back to them
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.29,1:02:06.13,general text,,0,0,0,,- I thought they wanted to kill you\N- As you can see, I’m still alive
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.75,1:02:09.13,general text,,0,0,0,,If they wanted to kill, they would have killed long ago
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.80,1:02:13.84,general text,,0,0,0,,If I return, I can restore my energy
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.56,1:02:22.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I promised to help you...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.02,1:02:25.65,general text,,0,0,0,,And I said I would push you off the cliff
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.86,1:02:30.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I know I trained you too hard,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.19,1:02:33.36,general text,,0,0,0,,and you did everything in your power
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.70,1:02:37.12,general text,,0,0,0,,- We can continue...\N- No
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.20,1:02:40.24,general text,,0,0,0,,If we stick together, you'll die
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.99,1:02:42.58,general text,,0,0,0,,And I’ll get caught
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.89,1:03:08.06,general text,,0,0,0,,What made the head of Sosnovy Bor secretly come all the way here?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.15,1:03:09.61,general text,,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.27,1:03:14.32,general text,,0,0,0,,about the magician of Jeonbugwan named Cho Chun, who died 20 years ago
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.74,1:03:21.53,italics,,0,0,0,,Father Nak Soo, Cho Chun,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.45,1:03:23.62,general text,,0,0,0,,mastered the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.62,1:03:27.58,general text,,0,0,0,,When we found him,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.08,1:03:30.34,general text,,0,0,0,,he has already gone wild
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.42,1:03:34.34,general text,,0,0,0,,and killed his entire family
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.30,1:03:43.43,italics,,0,0,0,,Four families had to fit in,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.14,1:03:45.77,italics,,0,0,0,,to stop the bloodshed
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.11,1:03:55.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su’s father was also a nomad?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.53,1:03:58.20,general text,,0,0,0,,In the eyes of a child,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.28,1:04:01.78,general text,,0,0,0,,probably we are the killers of her father
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.99,1:04:07.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Surely she blamed us for his death
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.87,1:04:10.46,general text,,0,0,0,,and that’s why I came to Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.75,1:04:15.67,general text,,0,0,0,,What important issue did you want to discuss?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.76,1:04:18.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Remember something about Nak Su?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.76,1:04:25.89,memories,,0,0,0,,If we meet again, I will kill you
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.98,1:04:32.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Hinting,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.94,1:04:36.23,general text,,0,0,0,,that I took Cho Chun’s daughter under my wing and made her a mercenary?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.32,1:04:39.61,general text,,0,0,0,,You burned her body as soon as you found it
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.70,1:04:42.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Not to hide her identity?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.66,1:04:48.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Instead of answering, I’ll tell you about what happened 20 years ago
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.04,1:04:53.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Here in Jeonbugwan we record the stars...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.04,1:04:56.30,general text,,0,0,0,,from one in the morning to three, when energy is at its peak
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.42,1:05:00.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju checks recording at noon, signs are stored here
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.30,1:05:07.27,general text,,0,0,0,,One day the sign written down that morning disappeared
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.27,1:05:12.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, we managed to find her
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.19,1:05:17.86,general text,,0,0,0,,When was this?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.70,1:05:25.58,general text,,0,0,0,,The day Chang Gang's wife, Do Hwa, died and Chang Wook was born
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.74,1:05:28.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Chun wrote down the stars that day,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.87,1:05:32.42,general text,,0,0,0,,and I was the one who found the missing sign
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.72,1:05:49.22,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I managed to steal the real sign
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.31,1:05:52.60,memories,,0,0,0,,In Jeonbugwan, a fake without the King's star
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.19,1:05:59.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to say,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.46,1:06:01.90,general text,,0,0,0,,what do you know
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.03,1:06:04.99,general text,,0,0,0,,about what happened when...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.87,1:06:08.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Is Chan Wook born?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.83,1:06:15.17,general text,,0,0,0,,A star ready to change the world has appeared in the sky
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.34,1:06:23.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you know about the King's star?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.09,1:06:25.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you think that the secret would die with Cho Chun?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.55,1:06:30.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Who do you think turned him into a soul swallower?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.02,1:06:36.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t ask questions to which you don’t want to know the answer
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.85,1:06:40.02,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the only way you will protect Sosnovy Bor and its inhabitants
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.83,1:06:56.00,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Dan Joo doesn’t know you’re still alive, Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.88,1:06:59.38,memories,,0,0,0,,I didn’t tell him
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.21,1:07:01.67,memories,,0,0,0,,Bring Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.75,1:07:03.72,memories,,0,0,0,,Then I'll keep my mouth shut
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.26,1:07:10.72,memories,,0,0,0,,I'm going to transfer my soul into his body
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.24,1:07:31.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is Chan Wook?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.37,1:07:33.75,general text,,0,0,0,,He will come soon
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.42,1:07:43.00,general text,,0,0,0,,What brings you here at such a late hour?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.47,1:07:47.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Before Uk was born...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.09,1:07:51.35,general text,,0,0,0,,About 20 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.43,1:07:52.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Could Chang Gan...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.97,1:07:56.06,general text,,0,0,0,,master a certain type of magic?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.40,1:08:00.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Gan was able...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.27,1:08:04.11,general text,,0,0,0,,relocate the soul?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.58,1:08:21.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is it taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.55,1:08:26.01,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s finally starting to rain
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.96,1:08:28.26,general text,,0,0,0,,He will be here now
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.55,1:08:33.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you fooled me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.22,1:08:38.27,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.81,1:08:42.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Since Dan Zhu still hasn’t appeared,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.98,1:08:45.57,general text,,0,0,0,,so you really didn’t tell him anything
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.28,1:08:48.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh you...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.97,1:09:14.30,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Here we say goodbye
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.35,1:09:18.56,memories,,0,0,0,,What about the empty temple in the forest?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.23,1:09:22.85,memories,,0,0,0,,Why don’t you want to take me with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.94,1:09:25.02,memories,,0,0,0,,I was going to get rid of you there in order to save myself
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.86,1:09:28.90,memories,,0,0,0,,Now you know, don’t even think about following me
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.65,1:09:32.49,memories,,0,0,0,,Then you shouldn't have told me about that temple
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.70,1:09:35.74,memories,,0,0,0,,Let you go alone,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.53,1:09:38.54,memories,,0,0,0,,knowing that it was dangerous there?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.79,1:09:43.29,memories,,0,0,0,,I feel worse now than you
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.37,1:09:45.92,memories,,0,0,0,,I missed my chance at life because of some bird's egg
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.00,1:09:48.13,memories,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I could remind you of devotion
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.21,1:09:49.76,memories,,0,0,0,,I really could have died
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.68,1:09:55.72,memories,,0,0,0,,I helped you avoid death,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.97,1:09:59.10,memories,,0,0,0,,so fight to the death
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.18,1:10:03.85,memories,,0,0,0,,Speaking as if you saved me
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.35,1:10:08.02,memories,,0,0,0,,If the cloudy sky blesses us with rain,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.69,1:10:11.74,memories,,0,0,0,,then we can both live
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.54,1:10:22.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Luck and truth are on your side, Uk
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.83,1:10:24.58,general text,,0,0,0,,There is heavy rain outside
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.50,1:10:27.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I think my opponent is not much stronger than me
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.96,1:10:30.59,general text,,0,0,0,,He is a magician from Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.67,1:10:32.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Hello. Do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.27,1:12:48.68,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Here it is. Now is the time to use tansu
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.77,1:12:52.06,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Don’t try to divide the drops with an uncontrolled sword,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.15,1:12:54.44,offscreen,,0,0,0,,hold the sword so that drops fall on it
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.58,1:13:53.79,general text,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.50,1:13:58.80,general text,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.88,1:13:59.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Alchemy of Souls
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.10,1:14:53.43,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,My soul...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.02,1:14:55.52,offscreen,,0,0,0,,moving now?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.00,1:15:18.42,preview,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.75,1:15:23.46,preview,,0,0,0,,So you swapped bodies with my student, Gil Joo
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.55,1:15:26.09,preview,,0,0,0,,I think Uk became a victim of transmigration of souls
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.18,1:15:27.09,preview,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.18,1:15:29.68,preview,,0,0,0,,The man who transmigrated my father's soul...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.76,1:15:31.89,preview,,0,0,0,,is this Jin Moo from Jeonbugwan?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.93,1:15:36.44,preview,,0,0,0,,Is that you? Isn't it you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.52,1:15:39.69,preview,,0,0,0,,Are you sure the ice stone was destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.31,1:15:42.65,preview,,0,0,0,,Order all our magicians to find Gil Zhu
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.73,1:15:45.15,preview,,0,0,0,,It must remain a secret that they are nomads
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.15,1:15:47.15,general text,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,

Comment: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:47.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Beta editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Sana
